    captions: [[0.0, "Two teams line up on the west sideline: blue north of the cone, red south of it. The coach stands just behind the cone."], [0.6, "The coach rolls a ball out, about 9 yards along the 20-yard line."], [1.0, "Two red players and one blue player, the ones closest to the cone, go for it."], [2.3, "They fight for the ground ball."], [2.9, "Red scoops it. Keep-away starts: 2 red against 1 blue, so blue is a player down."], [11.9, "The coach blows the whistle once: release! The next player from each team joins."], [13.1, "Now 3 red against 2 blue, so blue is a player down. Same job: one defender on the ball, the others cover the open players."], [16.9, "Blue pokes the ball away and takes it. Blue now keeps it away from Red."], [24.9, "The coach blows the whistle once: release! The next player from each team joins."], [26.1, "Now 4 red against 3 blue, so blue is a player down. Same job: one defender on the ball, the others cover the open players."], [33.9, "The coach blows the whistle once: release! The next player from each team joins."], [35.1, "Now 5 red against 4 blue, so blue is a player down. Same job: one defender on the ball, the others cover the open players."], [41.9, "The coach counts down: 5"], [42.9, "The coach counts down: 4"], [43.9, "The coach counts down: 3"], [44.9, "The coach counts down: 2"], [45.9, "The coach counts down: 1"], [46.9, "Time! Blue has the ball, so blue wins the round. The coach calls reset."]],
